<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Atlas Copco cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Atlas Copco cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Chris Heminway said on Monday he had downgraded his rating of Swedish industrial engineering group Atlas Copco AB to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- Heminway wrote that there was &quot;some risk that 1997 could be a dull year in terms of demand&quot; and &quot;we are downgrading based on strong performance of last 12 months.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
